                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is Dubai the right first international market for a perfume brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for most brands. Higher AOV, strong niche appreciation, tourist demand, and gateway to GCC + Saudi. Only skip if compliance path (halal, ESMA) is a blocker.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does a UAE perfume launch cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Full launch (entity, storefront, initial inventory, launch marketing): ₹1-3 Cr / $120K-360K over 12 months. Under-investment is common; brands that half-launch usually fail.</p>
                                        <h3>Is sampling worth the cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — sampling programs convert 15-30% of samplers within 90 days. The unit economics work if you price the sample kit to break even on shipping + product cost.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I focus on oud, floral, or fresh scents?</h3>
                                        <p>Oud is huge in UAE and increasingly global. Floral and fresh play in USA / UK / Australia. Portfolio approach with 3-4 scent families outperforms single-family focus.</p>
